display_name = "Dodge roll"
designer_notes = "THE FOUNDATION'S ROLL (DECISIONS #309; Regent's own until PROGRESS 77): rolls, Rolling (101) for regents.roll_ms, no roll in the air, on the dash key (key empty: Ctrl, as the combat component binds it); the adventurer names it as its dodge_roll. What a roll does to a fight is game/regents.rs `on_roll`. Before: Ctrl: the roll's movement is the adventurer's dash, predicted at once; this ability gives its i-frames (the Rolling status) and cancels a swing. Its key is the combat component's (game/regents/combat/), not the foundation's attack key."
